WEBVTT

00:02.686 --> 00:06.076
It seems today that all you see

00:06.166 --> 00:09.442
Is violence in movies and sex on TV

00:09.526 --> 00:13.075
But where are those
good old-fashioned values

00:13.166 --> 00:15.157
On which we used to rely?

00:16.166 --> 00:19.397
Lucky there's a family guy

00:19.486 --> 00:24.401
Lucky there's a man who positively
can do all the things that make us

00:24.486 --> 00:26.078
Laugh and cry

00:26.166 --> 00:31.365
He's a family guy

00:34.966 --> 00:37.275
Boy, that lotion sure feels good.

00:37.366 --> 00:40.756
- Sure is hot.
- And it just got hotter.

00:40.846 --> 00:43.041
Here. Now let me do you.

00:44.006 --> 00:48.955
Pawtucket Patriot beer. If you buy it,
hot women will have sex in your back yard.

00:49.046 --> 00:52.561
Typical male fantasy! Women drinking beer!

00:52.646 --> 00:55.160
I guarantee you a man made that commercial.

00:55.246 --> 00:59.603
Of course a man made it. It's a commercial,
Lois, not a delicious Thanksgiving dinner.

00:59.686 --> 01:03.235
Dad, we won a boat! We won a boat! Ha-ha!

01:03.326 --> 01:06.318
Holy crap! We did!
We won a free freakin' boat!

01:06.406 --> 01:08.556
Dad, nobody gives things away for free.

01:08.646 --> 01:11.399
