- Who cares? I bet nobody took the boat.

04:07.486 --> 04:11.001
Who could resist the call of the mystery box?

04:11.086 --> 04:12.917
Yahoo!

04:13.006 --> 04:16.681
Hey, look at me!
I'm the man in the boat! All right!

04:18.286 --> 04:21.881
- Joe, look to the right. It's the Griffins.
- We're nautical now, baby.

04:21.966 --> 04:27.438
