about being a sucker.

04:50.006 --> 04:55.956
Oh, Quagmire,
you're what the Spaniards call el terrible.

04:56.046 --> 04:58.640
Why are you upset?
I never even knew you liked boats.

04:58.726 --> 05:02.321
Boating's in my blood. Ever since
my great-grandfather, Huck Griffin,

05:02.406 --> 05:04.362
