- I... I thought that was your name.

05:07.726 --> 05:10.286
That is our word. You've got no right using it.

05:10.366 --> 05:12.800
Hey, hey, hey. I'm cool, I'm cool. No problem.

05:14.806 --> 05:18.640
- Could you pass me the oar, N-word Jim.
- Thank you.

05:20.566 --> 05:24.081
This comic sucks!
He couldn't make me laugh

05:24.166 --> 05:28.239
