and he was making me do it. Huh?

05:28.326 --> 05:32.239
- Come on, Skinny! Make me laugh!
- Peter, that's a microphone stand.

05:32.326 --> 05:34.237
Oh, well, pardon me for thinking

05:34.326 --> 05:37.557
