06:21.686 --> 06:24.723
Hey, hey, how about that Viagra, huh?

06:24.806 --> 06:27.718
You know what that stuff does? Huh?

06:27.806 --> 06:29.444
Huh?

06:29.526 --> 06:31.244
Come on!

06:31.326 --> 06:33.715
What, are you people stupid?

06:35.966 --> 06:39.003
Ah! You like a little abuse, huh?

06:39.086 --> 06:42.635
Yeah. Well, you gu...
you guys are stupid and ugly.

06:43.486 --> 06:48.162
If there was a stupid-and-ugly contest,
