08:33.406 --> 08:35.761
Sarah... Sarah... I don't...

08:35.846 --> 08:38.838
Oh, is she the one
we video-taped taking a dump?

08:39.526 --> 08:41.437
Why? What happened?

08:45.886 --> 08:49.196
Sexual harassment is
a very serious charge, Mr Griffin.

08:49.286 --> 08:53.564
First of all, if I can speak in my own defence,
