08:53.646 --> 08:55.523
Second of all, women are not people.

08:55.606 --> 08:59.155
They are devices built by the Lord
Jesus Christ for our entertainment.

08:59.246 --> 09:00.361
Peter, please!

09:00.446 --> 09:05.236
Miss Ironbox, I assure you this company
