11:42.486 --> 11:44.761
Look at me. Look at me!

11:47.806 --> 11:50.878
Hello, ladies. I'm Miss Watson,
director of the retreat.

11:50.966 --> 11:55.835
I'd like to welcome Peter Griffin, who's here
